---
// FAQ (#faq), STRUCTURE.md §7. Native <details>, so it works without JS and every row can be open at
// once. Answers sit on parchment (V6-015). Every claim is checked in docs/v6/landing/NOTES.md
// ("V6-LAND-05", re-checked in "V6-LAND-06"): every answer is true of the game as merged today and
// promises no v6 feature whose UI has not landed (web sign-in and linking, rebinding, in-app deletion).
// Styles: styles/below.css. No FAQPage JSON-LD: Google no longer shows FAQ results for sites like
// this one, and mobile LCP has no bytes to spare (V6-032).
---
<section class="section faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section__head">
      <h2 id="faq-title" class="section__title">Questions</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="faq__list">
      <details>
        <summary>Is it free to play?</summary>
        <p class="faq__a">Yes. In Telegram, Stars buy Drachmae for cosmetics, the season pass and shortcuts; gear and heroes are never sold. Purchases are not available on the web yet.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Do I need Telegram?</summary>
        <p class="faq__a">No. The campaign plays in your browser with no account. Online duels and the war are played in Telegram for now.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can I play on a laptop or tablet?</summary>
        <p class="faq__a">Yes: phones, tablets and laptops, by touch or with mouse and keyboard, battle hotkeys included.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Is my progress saved?</summary>
        <p class="faq__a">Your campaign saves on your device, and in Telegram it also syncs to the cloud. Duels and the war live on the server.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Which languages?</summary>
        <p class="faq__a">English and Russian.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What happens to my data?</summary>
        <p class="faq__a">Only what the game needs. Read the <a href="/privacy">privacy notice</a>; to have your data deleted, send /delete_my_data to the bot.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
